Product Description
1 HDMI input, 1 HDMI output, 1 optical fiber output, 1 AUX 2.5 headphone stereo output; 
2, support ARC, independent ARC toggle switch; 
3, a variety of audio output interface output at the same time: fiber optic support DTS, Dolby source code, stereo; 3.5 headphone interface supports PCM format stereo; 
4, Standard 2.0 version, support 4K@60Hz HDR Dolby Vision;. 
5, support HDCP 2.2, backward compatible with HDCP 1.4, support for HDCP 2.2&1.4 crack function; 
6, strong compatibility, support X-BOX/PS-4 PRO/ROKU/APPLE TV/Samsung/LG/Sony. 
7, Adopt 24 bit/192 KHz DAC chip to ensure high quality sound; 
8, No signal loss, the output HDMI is the same as the input HDMI 
